The original branch was `if (pendingInvite && onboardingV3Enabled)`, which sends only users with a pending invite to personal settings when the v3 flag is on. The PR changes it to `hasPendingInvite || onboardingV3Enabled`.

With v3 on, every user now gets `/onboarding/personal/settings`, and the `/onboarding/getting-started` return on line 73 becomes unreachable whenever v3 is enabled. This is a product-wide routing change that the PR description never mentions. The PR is about invited users only.

